{
  "movie_id": 220500201,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 0.4,
      "end_time": 1.3,
      "text": "*giggle*"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 1.5,
      "end_time": 4.3,
      "text": "Of course, I know"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 5.2,
      "end_time": 10.2,
      "text": "My younger sister told me about you all in great detail─"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 13.1,
      "end_time": 14.5,
      "text": "GRRRRAAAAGHHH!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 16.5,
      "end_time": 17.5,
      "text": "Oh no!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 18.1,
      "end_time": 19.7,
      "text": "Behind you!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 22.3,
      "end_time": 23.5,
      "text": "Huh...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 24.2,
      "end_time": 25.6,
      "text": "No need to interfere"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 26.1,
      "end_time": 27.6,
      "text": "Against someone like Princess"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 28.0,
      "end_time": 30.0,
      "text": "It's nothing more than a fly"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 34.4,
      "end_time": 36.0,
      "text": "Guaaaah..."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 42.2,
      "end_time": 45.5,
      "text": "You all have no luck, do you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 46.0,
      "end_time": 50.2,
      "text": "For this place, Gio Gehenna, is on the verge of burning to ashes"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 50.4,
      "end_time": 52.6,
      "text": "And to arrive at such a moment, that is"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 53.2,
      "end_time": 56.1,
      "text": "...So, could it be..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 56.3,
      "end_time": 59.3,
      "text": "Is it because of that big grilled chicken?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 59.6,
      "end_time": 60.6,
      "text": "'Grilled chicken'?"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 61.3,
      "end_time": 63.2,
      "text": "Ufufufufuー"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 63.6,
      "end_time": 68.3,
      "text": "'Grilled chicken' it may be, but it is one of highest quality"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 68.5,
      "end_time": 70.3,
      "text": "That creature is─"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 72.1,
      "end_time": 73.9,
      "text": "*shriek*"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 90.4,
      "end_time": 91.4,
      "text": "*sigh*..."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 91.7,
      "end_time": 93.6,
      "text": "I thought I was going to burn to death～"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 94.5,
      "end_time": 95.4,
      "text": "That creature is─"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 95.6,
      "end_time": 99.6,
      "text": "One of the 'Six Calamities'"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 100.1,
      "end_time": 103.6,
      "text": "The phoenix of purgatory, 'Kaleid Phoenix'"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 104.4,
      "end_time": 111.5,
      "text": "One amongst the most fearsome creatures, standing at the apex of this survival-of-the-fittest world"
    }
  ],
